BacBench `run_train_cls.py`: vendored verbatim as a provenance reference
========================================================================

Source  : macwiatrak/Bacbench
URL     : https://github.com/macwiatrak/Bacbench/blob/64b7d45823b2ff2ef88458e3aa235caa461a12aa/bacbench/tasks/essential_genes/run_train_cls.py
Commit  : 64b7d45823b2ff2ef88458e3aa235caa461a12aa
